  "label": "Victimhood Meme Trope",
  "description": "The meme uses the trope of exaggerated victimization, where an individual claims to be 'victimized' by a trivial or minor situation. This trope is often used humorously to highlight absurdity, but in this context, it is applied to a woman, reinforcing gendered expectations about emotional expression and self-pity.",
